
@baseUri = http://localhost:8183/api
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Listar talhões
GET {{baseUri}}/plots
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Cadastrar talhão
POST {{baseUri}}/plots
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Vale",
    "area_ha": 8
}


### Testar nome duplicado
POST {{baseUri}}/plots
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "vale",
    "area_ha": 10
}


### Testar área inválida
POST {{baseUri}}/plots
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Campo Novo",
    "area_ha": 0
}


### Testar área negativa
POST {{baseUri}}/plots
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Campo Teste",
    "area_ha": -5
}


### Editar talhão Vale
PUT {{baseUri}}/plots/3
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
    "name": "Vale Atualizado",
    "area_ha": 10
}


### Excluir talhão Vale Atualizado
DELETE {{baseUri}}/plots/3
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Testar acesso sem token
GET {{baseUri}}/plots
Accept: application/json

